  "ruleText": "He-P 3202.05 Priority System. If funding is insufficient for complete participation within the area serviced by the local agency, participation shall be limited by the use of prioritization in accordance with 7 CFR 246.7(e)(4).\n\nSource. #4518, eff 10-28-88; EXPIRED 10-28-94\n\nNew. #6226, eff 4-24-96; ss by #7489, eff 5-11-01; ss by #7774, eff 10-8-02; ss by #8580, eff 3-11-06; ss by #9556, eff 10-1-09; ss by #10583, eff 10-1-14; ss by #12858, eff 8-23-19",
